> U_X=min(floor((h+z)/2), d(G[X])+floor(z/2)). This improves the earlier
> incident-edge cutoff; it does not give a constant cutoff or select X.
> A_window/B_window remain **CONJECTURAL**, equivalent to A/B on critical
